# Outfit head (R18): a noir fedora: a low pinched crown, a wide brim snapped down at the front, accent band.
# Head frame: the head fills x 3..8, y 3..7, z 0..5 (pivot 5 5 0).
name outfit_fedora
grid 5
size 12 10 7
slot felt SwatchMain
slot band SwatchAccent
cyl 5.5 5 4 5 4.8 felt
box 9 2 3 12 8 4 felt
carve box 9 2 4 12 8 5
carve box 3 3 4 8 7 5
cyl 5.5 5 5 7 2.9 felt
carve box 4 4.5 6 8 5.5 7
carve box 7 3 6 9 4 7
carve box 7 6 6 9 7 7
paint cyl 5.5 5 5 6 2.9 band
pivot 5 5 0
